## Project snippets

A chronological log of project updates and notes. You can [subscribe via
RSS]($link.page('projects').alternative('rss')); this page lists entries for 2026,
and past or future years are in the [projects archive](/projects/).

## [Presented at SER Annual Meeting]($section.id("2026-06-25T00:00:00"))
Presentation on the [legal epidemiology](/trails/legal-epidemiology/) project,
including preliminary results from T. Hill's Master's thesis, at the
Society for Epidemiologic Research (SER) 2026 Annual Meeting in Phoenix.

## [Master's thesis at NYU ML4Good Lab]($section.id("2026-01-01T00:00:00"))
The NYU [Machine Learning for Good Lab](https://wp.nyu.edu/ml4good/) is hosting a
Master's thesis project (T. Hill) related to the [AI for legal
epidemiology](/trails/legal-epidemiology/) project. (Jan.--May)

